      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">How to start a badminton club</h1>
      <p class="lede">Starting a club is less daunting than it looks. Find somewhere to play, get a core of players together, sort a few basics, and run a good first session. This is the practical guide to each step, from empty hall to a night people come back to.</p>
