<section style="padding-top:40px">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
    <div class="guide-toc">
      <h4>In this guide</h4>
      <a href="#venue">1. Find a venue</a>
      <a href="#players">2. Get your players together</a>
      <a href="#kit">3. Sort the kit and shuttles</a>
      <a href="#money">4. Fees, insurance and affiliation</a>
      <a href="#structure">5. A light bit of structure</a>
      <a href="#firstnight">6. Run a great first session</a>
